{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.SpinInvolution","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.SpinInvolution","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":25,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.two_mul_isospinT3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.two_mul_isospinT3","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L170-L174","doc":"Doubled isospin `2·T₃ = sgn_σ` recovers the integer spin sign. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.isospinT3_doublet_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.isospinT3_doublet_neg","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L166-L168","doc":"On the **negative** spin-doublet component (`sgn = -1`): `T₃ = -½`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.isospinT3_doublet_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.isospinT3_doublet_pos","kind":"theorem","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L162-L164","doc":"On the **positive** spin-doublet component (`sgn = +1`): `T₃ = +½`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.isospinT3_singlet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.isospinT3_singlet","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L157-L160","doc":"On the **spin-singlet** sector (`sgn = 0`) the isospin third component\nvanishes: `T₃ = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.isospinT3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.isospinT3","kind":"def","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L153-L155","doc":"Isospin third component from the three-valued spin sign\n`sgn ∈ {-1, 0, +1}`: `T₃ = ½ · sgn`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.sigma_eq_plus_sub_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.sigma_eq_plus_sub_minus","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L132-L139","doc":"The spin decomposition is `σ`-diagonalising: `σ a = a₊ - a₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.plus_inter_minus_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.plus_inter_minus_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L120-L130","doc":"The two sectors intersect only in `0`: an element that is both\n`σ`-fixed and `σ`-negated is zero (uses `2` invertible). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.plus_add_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.plus_add_minus","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L111-L118","doc":"The spin decomposition `a = a₊ + a₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.sigma_minusProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.sigma_minusProj","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L105-L109","doc":"`a₋` lies in the `-1`-eigenspace: `σ (a₋) = -a₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.sigma_plusProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.sigma_plusProj","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L99-L103","doc":"`a₊` lies in the `+1`-eigenspace: `σ (a₊) = a₊`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.minusProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.minusProj","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L93-L95","doc":"The **spin-doublet projection** `a₋ = ½ (a - σ a) ∈ A₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.plusProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.plusProj","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L89-L91","doc":"The **spin-singlet projection** `a₊ = ½ (a + σ a) ∈ A₊`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_sub","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L78-L80","doc":"`σ (a - b) = σ a - σ b`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_neg","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L72-L76","doc":"`σ (-a) = -(σ a)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_zero","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L66-L70","doc":"`σ 0 = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.spin_involution_bijective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.spin_involution_bijective","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L50-L56","doc":"A spin involution is bijective: it is its own two-sided inverse,\ndirectly from the involution axiom. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.star_compat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.star_compat","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L48-L48","doc":"`*`-compatible: `σ (star a) = star (σ a)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.trace_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.trace_inv","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Trace-invariant: `τ (σ a) = τ a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.anti_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.anti_mul","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Anti-multiplicative: `σ (a*b) = σ b * σ a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.involutive","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Involution: `σ ∘ σ = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_add","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L40-L40","doc":"`σ` is additive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.map_smul","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L38-L38","doc":"`σ` is `R`-linear. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.σ","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L36-L36","doc":"The underlying map `σ : A → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpinInvolution","kind":"structure","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.lean#L31-L48","doc":"A **spin involution** on a Frobenius `*`-algebra: an `R`-linear,\ninvolutive, anti-multiplicative, trace- and `*`-compatible map. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:spin-involution","label":"def:spin-involution","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/spin-involution.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}